blic","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-11T14:27:30Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T16:11:57Z","closed_at":"2025-06-20T13:47:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103972","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-20T13:47:50Z"},"body":"As the title mentions, this PR adds support for developing and debugging hybrid apps directly from the XR editor.\r\n\r\nFor context, [Hybrid Apps](https://godotvr.github.io/godot_openxr_vendors/manual/hybrid_apps.html) are applications capable of swapping between an immersive 3D mode and a 2D panel mode at runtime.\r\nThe Godot XR editor itself is an hybrid app, and with this update, it gains and provides the ability to developers to create hybrid apps directly from a standalone XR device.\r\n\r\nRecording using the [Hybrid App sample project](https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/3980) from a Quest 3 device:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb69bf80-3a6a-4b18-8541-58a8fa579f42\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**Note:** Hybrid apps require [v4 of the Godot OpenXR Vendor plugin](https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors/releases/tag/4.0.0-stable)\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103972/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103972/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}